## 📤 Request Payload Format

### QwenCloud API Request
```json
{
  "model": "qwen3.5-flash",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Extract data from this invoice..."
        },
        {
          "type": "image_url",
          "image_url": {
            "url": "https://your-project.supabase.co/storage/v1/sign/attachments/file.jpg?token=..."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0,
  "max_tokens": 4096
}
```

### Headers
```
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_QWEN_API_KEY
```

---

## 📥 Response Parser

### QwenCloud API Response Format
```json
{
  "output": {
    "choices": [
      {
        "message": {
          "content": "{\"document_type\":\"credit_invoice\",\"customer_name\":\"John Doe\",...}"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "usage": {
    "prompt_tokens": 1234,
    "completion_tokens": 567,
    "total_tokens": 1801
  }
}
```

### Parser Implementation
```typescript
private extractContent(response: any): string {
  const content = response?.output?.choices?.[0]?.message?.content;
  
  if (!content) {
    throw new Error('QwenCloud API returned empty response content');
  }
  
  if (typeof content === 'string') {
    return content;
  }
  
  // Handle array content (multimodal responses)
  if (Array.isArray(content)) {
    const textBlocks = content
      .filter((block: any) => block.type === 'text')
      .map((block: any) => block.text)
      .join('\n');
    
    if (textBlocks) {
      return textBlocks;
    }
  }
  
  throw new Error('QwenCloud API returned unexpected response format');
}
```

