## 🚀 Deployment Steps

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
cd d:\Projects\KSMN Kanakku-book
npm install
```

### 2. Deploy Edge Function
```bash
# Deploy the ai-scan function
supabase functions deploy ai-scan
```

### 3. Configure Supabase Secrets
```bash
# Set QwenCloud API key
supabase secrets set QWEN_API_KEY=your_real_qwencloud_api_key

# Set model (optional, defaults to qwen3.5-flash)
supabase secrets set QWEN_MODEL=qwen3.5-flash
```

**Important:** Replace `your_real_qwencloud_api_key` with your actual QwenCloud API key.

### 4. Verify Storage Bucket
```bash
# Check existing buckets
supabase storage ls

# If no bucket exists, create one
supabase storage create attachments
```

